{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Behold, to bless I have received.</b> An expression of appointment, like (Genesis 27:39) הנה משמני הארץ. And the intent is to say: I have received the blessings from on high, for the Holy One, blessed be He, places the words in my mouth, <b>and He has blessed, and I cannot reverse it</b>; and therefore I cannot reverse the blessing, for speech is in no hand but that of the blessed Name, as it is written (Proverbs 16): ומה׳ מענה לשון."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:35:26.676908197Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}